      "message": "\u003e In our case, the reason why trace_pelt_se_tp is insufficient is that\nit doesn\u0027t not record old value(e.g. util_avg) to know what delta before\nand after change.\n\nRight, I see. I seem to remember having this discussion in the past, and one solution was to have the vendor module attached to trace_pelt_se_tp() use one the VENDOR fields in task_struct to save a copy of the util_avg. That way every time trace_pelt_se_tp is called on a task with an updated util_avg, the module can lookup the old value in the VENDOR field. Any reason why that wouldn\u0027t work here? Thanks",
